[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.test. Test docstrings.

[_summary]
Root test package for the Shop plugin. Contains basic plugin loading and compatibility tests for Spigot-to-Paper migration.

[_conclusions]
Compatibility tests ensure migration from Spigot/Bukkit to PaperMC is working correctly.

[_does]
Verifies plugin loads in MockBukkit environment, tests Spigot-to-Paper migration compatibility (VaultUnlocked, GriefPrevention3D, Geyser/Floodgate).

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
VaultUnlocked positive path verified by direct field injection since MockBukkit ServerMock.pluginManager is final and cannot be stubbed.

